{"assets":["/statement-assets/80dfdb4a338e91b74efb71920d4f098bf47c9946154a68bd2df105df786cdba2.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"593","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Anton and Lines"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The teacher gave Anton a large geometry homework, but he didn't do it (as usual) as he participated in a regular round on Codeforces. In the task he was given a set of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines defined by the equations "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y = ki·x + bi"},{"kind":"text","text":". It was necessary to determine whether there is at least one point of intersection of two of these lines, that lays strictly inside the strip between "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x1 < x2"},{"kind":"text","text":". In other words, is it true that there are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ i < j ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x', y'"},{"kind":"text","text":", such that: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y' = ki * x' + bi"},{"kind":"text","text":", that is, point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(x', y')"},{"kind":"text","text":" belongs to the line number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y' = kj * x' + bj"},{"kind":"text","text":", that is, point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(x', y')"},{"kind":"text","text":" belongs to the line number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x1 < x' < x2"},{"kind":"text","text":", that is, point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(x', y')"},{"kind":"text","text":" lies inside the strip bounded by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x1 < x2"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You can't leave Anton in trouble, can you? Write a program that solves the given task."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains an integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2 ≤ n ≤ 100 000"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of lines in the task given to Anton. The second line contains integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x1"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x2"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" - 1 000 000 ≤ x1 < x2 ≤ 1 000 000"},{"kind":"text","text":") defining the strip inside which you need to find a point of intersection of at least two lines."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The following "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contain integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ki"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" - 1 000 000 ≤ ki, bi ≤ 1 000 000"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the descriptions of the lines. It is guaranteed that all lines are pairwise distinct, that is, for any two "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i ≠ j"},{"kind":"text","text":" it is true that either "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ki ≠ kj"},{"kind":"text","text":", or "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi ≠ bj"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without quotes), if there is at least one intersection of two distinct lines, located strictly inside the strip. Otherwise print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"No"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without quotes)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n1 2\n1 2\n1 0\n0 1\n0 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"NO"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n1 3\n1 0\n-1 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"YES"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n1 3\n1 0\n0 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"child